      "value": "@{5b6b4e8cb1b04a6db0be465d|full_name}: dont use cloud customer storage providers for hosting movies to watch in groups of people, its just not made for that. Dropbox and all others can just block download for some people because its unusal for a group to download like that and they are not a streaming platform - its kinda in their bussness to block usage lika that to limit abuse, so they are probably just doing that.\nUse something that is made for that, like bunndy cdn, cheap and works 10/10",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
