      "value": "@{5f41f69f26564626123ddbff|full_name}: Not a YouTube specific issue. Everything might work fine for you, but it won't for some other people, that is the problem and why I label them as \"unreliable\". I'm usually able to see most videos and movies. When I'm hosting a movie and 30 people show up, and 8 of them can't see the video though, it really sucks for those 8 people and I feel bad since pretty much the only thing I can tell them is \"Sorry, you're shit out of luck\".\nNot to mention the other issues of stuff like sync or stutter and late joiners not being able to see the current video until the next video is entered in, which are also big issues that are not youtube specific.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
