      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also the non-udon video players were broken over 7 months ago and still have not been fixed in terms of them being unable to do anything at all except for \"Play\" since options like Pause, Stop, Fast Forward, Resync, etc. are all broken and do not work. Not sure if this will ever be fixed though as it seems like development has completely stopped for anything SDK2 related.\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/1061-vrcsyncvideostream-pause-fast-forwardrewind-and-resync-rpcs-broken",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
