  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-07T05:49:32.304Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Not sure what happened since the latest patch or two but none of the video players work well anymore. I host a lot of events and there are constant issues with some people being able to see the video, other people not being able to see the video, sync issues, not being able to see the current video of a map playing if you're a late joiner, sometimes stutter-y video, etc. This happens on almost every map and every video player.",
